{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40647","headline":"登圭峰旧隐寄荐福栖白上人 · 李洞","name":"登圭峰旧隐寄荐福栖白上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"返照塔轮边，残霖滴几悬。\n夜寒吟病甚，秋健讲声圆。\n粟穗乾灯焰，苔根浊水泉。\n西峰埋藓石，秋月即师禅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}